          "caption": "Avoiding Midges. Camp on the Bealach na Ba road. Up here at 620m in a successful attempt to avoid the swarms of biting insects that plague the Highlands each summer. They are still here, but not so persistent.\nGround is typical Torridonian, sandstone and thin peaty soils.",
